---
---

<section id="faq-industries" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-canvas relative overflow-hidden border-t border-hairline">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Industries Section -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/50 backdrop-blur-md mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mute tracking-wider uppercase">Industries We Serve</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-sans font-extralight tracking-[-0.02em] text-white mb-6">
        Custom Websites for Local Businesses.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-body text-pretty max-w-3xl mb-10">
        We know that every local business is unique. We don't just use standard templates; we build custom websites designed specifically for your industry to help you stand out and attract more customers.
      </p>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- HVAC -->
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 hover:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">HVAC Website Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">
            Need a great website for your HVAC business? We build sites that turn urgent visits into immediate calls. We make sure your site is fast, trustworthy, and easy to find on Google.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Roofing -->
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 hover:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Roofing Website Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">
            Turn online searches into booked roof inspections. We create professional websites that show off your past work and make it simple for customers to ask for a quote.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Medical -->
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 hover:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Healthcare & Clinics</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">
            Patient trust starts online. We build secure and professional medical websites that make patients feel welcome and comfortable before they even visit your clinic.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <div class="mt-32">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/50 backdrop-blur-md mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mute tracking-wider uppercase">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-sans font-extralight tracking-[-0.02em] text-white mb-12">
        Common Questions About Custom Websites.
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl">
        <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What is a custom website?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            A custom website is built from scratch just for your business. Unlike basic templates, it has a unique design, special features you need, and is built to be fast and easy to use.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What website services do you offer?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            We offer everything from designing how the site looks, building the code, adding custom features, connecting other tools, and keeping the site updated and easy to find on Google.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>How much does it cost to hire a web designer?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            The cost depends on what you need. Freelancers might charge $50 to $150 per hour, while agencies charge $100 to $300+. A full custom project can range from a few thousand to tens of thousands of dollars.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>How do I hire a website builder?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            First, figure out your budget and what you need the site to do. Look at their past work, read customer reviews, and talk with them to make sure they understand your goals and can communicate clearly.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What's the difference between a custom website and a template builder (like Wix)?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            A template builder is quick and cheap but limits how your site looks and works. A custom website is built specifically for you, meaning it can do exactly what you want, runs faster, is more secure, and can grow with your business.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What is the cost of a custom website?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            The cost depends on the size and features of the site. A simple custom site might start around $5,000, while a large platform with special features can cost $20,000 or more. It is an investment in your business.
          </div>
        </details>
        
        <!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>How long does it take to build a custom website?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            It usually takes 8 to 16 weeks to build a custom website. This includes planning, designing, writing the code, creating the text, and testing everything to make sure it works perfectly.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 8 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>Will my website work well on phones?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            Yes, absolutely. Every website we build is designed to look great and work perfectly on all devices, including phones, tablets, and computers.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 9 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl slide-up-card translate-y-32 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 md:col-span-2">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>Do you help maintain the website after it's done?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            Yes, we offer ongoing support plans. We handle security updates, check the site's speed, make text changes, and fix any technical issues so your website always runs smoothly.
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>

